# Reference only. Set secrets in the server's process environment, not in an .env file:
# Expo loads .env files into the dev server and has logged their values. Values without the
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix are only available to server code (API routes in src/app/api) and are
# never bundled into the app.

# Required for AI claim analysis. Create one at https://platform.claude.com/
# Must be an Anthropic key (sk-ant-...). Keys for other providers (e.g. OpenRouter, sk-or-...)
# are refused and never sent to Anthropic.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model used for claim analysis (default: claude-opus-5-5).
# TRUSTGUARD_CLAIM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5

# Optional: absolute URL of a deployed backend. Leave empty to use relative URLs
# (the Expo dev server in development, the expo-router `origin` in production builds).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
